Contains ad hoc patches for cross building with MinGW.

From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MXE
Date: Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add MinGW cross-compilation support

This patch adds support for building MSQUIC with MinGW-w64 cross-compiler.
Key changes:
- Add MinGW platform detection in CMakeLists.txt
- Create quic_platform_mingw.h compatibility header
- Add stubs for MSVC-specific intrinsics and Windows SDK types
- Handle ETW (Event Tracing for Windows) unavailability
- Fix MSVC-specific compiler/linker flags

